---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Mirai"
  description="Mirai's terms of service for website use and client engagements."
>
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-12">Last updated: January 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p>
          These Terms of Service govern your use of the Mirai website (themiraitech.com) and any services provided by Mirai Technology ("Mirai"). By using this site or engaging our services, you agree to these terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Website use</h2>
        <p>
          You may use this website for lawful purposes only. You agree not to use this site to transmit any harmful, offensive, or unlawful content, or to attempt to gain unauthorized access to any systems.
        </p>

        <h2>Services</h2>
        <p>
          Specific terms for service engagements (project scope, payment, IP ownership, confidentiality) are governed by the individual service agreements signed between Mirai and each client. Contact us for details.
        </p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this website (copy, design, code) is the property of Mirai unless otherwise noted. You may not reproduce or distribute any content without written permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          Results mentioned on this website (case studies, statistics) are from specific client engagements and are not guarantees of future results. AI system performance varies based on implementation, business context, and other factors.
        </p>

        <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, Mirai is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of this website or our services.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site constitutes acceptance of updated terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@themiraitech.com">hello@themiraitech.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
